386→                        <div id="content">If $\pi(x)$ counts the number of primes in $[1,x]$ then is it true that (for large $x$ and $y$)\[\pi(x+y) \leq \pi(x)+\pi(y)?\]</div>
387→                        <div id="problem_id"><a href="/855">#855</a>: <a href="#cite-Er61-855" onclick="event.preventDefault();addNewBox('Er61','855'); return false;">[Er61]</a><a href="#cite-Er65b-855" onclick="event.preventDefault();addNewBox('Er65b','855'); return false;">[Er65b]</a><a href="#cite-Er82e-855" onclick="event.preventDefault();addNewBox('Er82e','855'); return false;">[Er82e]</a><a href="#cite-Er85c-855" onclick="event.preventDefault();addNewBox('Er85c','855'); return false;">[Er85c]</a></div>
